units metal
dimension 3
boundary p p f
atom_style atomic
lattice bcc 3.3008
region box block 0 20 0 20 0 43
create_box 1 box
region projectile block 0 20 0 20 0 20
create_atoms 1 region projectile
region target block 0 20 0 20 23 43
create_atoms 1 region target
mass 1 92.90638
pair_style eam/fs
pair_coeff * * /home/holbrooe/LAMMPS-AST/publication/potentials/prompt3.potential Nb
group projectile region projectile
group target region target
velocity all create 300.0 12345 mom yes rot yes dist gaussian
timestep 0.001
fix 1 all nvt temp 300.0 300.0 0.1
thermo 100
thermo_style custom step temp pe ke etotal press
run 10
velocity projectile set 0.0 0.0 -20.0 sum yes units box
fix 2 all nve
dump 1 all custom 1000 dump.spall.* id type x y z vx vy vz
run 10
